WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.270
Indigestion can give
people a burning feeling.

2
00:00:03.320 --> 00:00:06.110
It is often linked to the
acid in their stomach.

3
00:00:06.160 --> 00:00:10.230
They take a small tablet, and
soon the burning starts to ease.

4
00:00:10.280 --> 00:00:13.470
So what does the tablet
actually do to the acid?

5
00:00:13.520 --> 00:00:16.330
Does it soak the acid
up, like a sponge?

6
00:00:16.380 --> 00:00:18.190
Or does something else happen?

7
00:00:18.240 --> 00:00:20.950
In this mission, you'll
meet acids and alkalis,

8
00:00:21.000 --> 00:00:25.330
and the pH scale, which runs
from nought to fourteen.

9
00:00:25.380 --> 00:00:27.370
You'll use indicators
that change colour,

10
00:00:27.420 --> 00:00:31.430
and you'll see what happens
when an acid meets an alkali.

11
00:00:31.480 --> 00:00:36.170
Your mission: explain how an
indigestion tablet eases the burn.
